{"slug": "C_S02E23", "video_name": "Community - S02E23 - A Fistful of Paintballs (1) Bluray-1080p Proper.mkv", "subtitle_name": "Community - S02E23 - A Fistful of Paintballs (1) Bluray-1080p Proper.en.srt", "duration_seconds": 1283.538, "language": "en", "stt_provider": "local", "stt_model": "ggml-small.en-q5_1.bin", "segment_count": 565, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 2.1365882352941172, "text": "No,"}, {"start": 2.1365882352941172, "end": 7.121960784313725, "text": "please,"}, {"start": 7.121960784313725, "end": 7.769411764705882, "text": "I"}, {"start": 7.769411764705882, "end": 14.172773109243696, "text": "don't even"}, {"start": 14.172773109243696, "end": 16.734117647058824, "text": "have"}, {"start": 16.734117647058824, "end": 20.32, "text": "a gun."}, {"start": 20.32, "end": 22.24, "text": "Isn't this against the rules?"}, {"start": 22.24, "end": 24.52, "text": "There's only one rule, Fat Neil."}, {"start": 24.52, "end": 28.44, "text": "The prize goes to the last man's stand."}, {"start": 28.44, "end": 29.44, "text": "So to speak."}, {"start": 29.44, "end": 35.47428571428571, "text": "You were a dude, you had"}, {"start": 35.47428571428571, "end": 41.76, "text": "my fist up, you're balls."}, {"start": 41.76, "end": 42.76, "text": "Thank you, Annie."}, {"start": 42.76, "end": 46.04, "text": "Kick their guns to me."}, {"start": 46.04, "end": 47.04, "text": "Kick?"}, {"start": 47.04, "end": 49.04, "text": "Don't reach."}, {"start": 49.04, "end": 50.64, "text": "Christina Ricci?"}, {"start": 50.64, "end": 51.94, "text": "I said kick."}, {"start": 51.94, "end": 54.32, "text": "Annie, take it easy."}, {"start": 54.32, "end": 60.0, "text": "You gotta learn to trust people."}, {"start": 60.0, "end": 64.2, "text": "Can't you leave me with a little something?"}, {"start": 64.2, "end": 66.8, "text": "We're friends, Annie, remember?"}, {"start": 66.8, "end": 69.96, "text": "We played Dungeons and Dragons together."}, {"start": 69.96, "end": 75.2, "text": "That was a game."}, {"start": 75.2, "end": 78.2, "text": "This is paintball."}, {"start": 78.2, "end": 82.43529411764706, "text": "You're a"}, {"start": 82.43529411764706, "end": 87.2, "text": "good guy."}, {"start": 87.2, "end": 92.37647058823529, "text": "You're a"}, {"start": 92.37647058823529, "end": 98.2, "text": "good guy."}, {"start": 98.2, "end": 101.7921052631579, "text": "Let's"}, {"start": 101.7921052631579, "end": 106.82105263157895, "text": "gather,"}, {"start": 106.82105263157895, "end": 110.8, "text": "Ralph."}, {"start": 110.8, "end": 114.05217391304348, "text": "OK, a"}, {"start": 114.05217391304348, "end": 119.90608695652173, "text": "couple of"}, {"start": 119.90608695652173, "end": 125.76, "text": "them out."}, {"start": 125.76, "end": 128.39454545454547, "text": "I want to thank Pistol Patty's Cowboy Creamery"}, {"start": 128.39454545454547, "end": 130.8, "text": "for sponsoring our end of the year picnic."}, {"start": 130.8, "end": 133.84809523809525, "text": "Now, three ice cream and that one guy"}, {"start": 133.84809523809525, "end": 137.72, "text": "having a heart attack aren't the only surprises"}, {"start": 137.72, "end": 138.72, "text": "today."}, {"start": 138.72, "end": 143.28, "text": "We're going to end this year with a quick game of paintball assassins."}, {"start": 143.28, "end": 149.56, "text": "Now, last year's big mistake was way too valuable a prize."}, {"start": 149.56, "end": 153.92, "text": "And I've been assured that this year will be different."}, {"start": 153.92, "end": 158.04, "text": "So take it away, Pistol Patty."}, {"start": 158.04, "end": 162.12, "text": "Patty, folks, there's only one rule."}, {"start": 162.12, "end": 164.12, "text": "Last man standing gets a prize."}, {"start": 164.12, "end": 167.88, "text": "There's your guns."}, {"start": 167.88, "end": 171.84, "text": "And here's the prize, $100,000 cash."}, {"start": 171.84, "end": 172.84, "text": "Good night."}, {"start": 172.84, "end": 178.225, "text": "I heard a"}, {"start": 178.225, "end": 183.60999999999999, "text": "rumor you"}, {"start": 183.60999999999999, "end": 186.87363636363636, "text": "never"}, {"start": 186.87363636363636, "end": 190.79, "text": "should"}, {"start": 190.79, "end": 196.7733333333333, "text": "have known"}, {"start": 196.7733333333333, "end": 201.56, "text": "our man."}, {"start": 204.23000000000002, "end": 205.23000000000002, "text": "Whoever started that rumor didn't eat my butt."}, {"start": 205.23000000000002, "end": 206.23000000000002, "text": "I didn't eat my beans."}, {"start": 206.23000000000002, "end": 211.55, "text": "Then I guess it's lucky for me I'm not unarmed."}, {"start": 211.55, "end": 215.3409677419355, "text": "Seeing as I'm"}, {"start": 215.3409677419355, "end": 220.59, "text": "eating your beans."}, {"start": 220.59, "end": 221.59, "text": "Jeff wants to see you."}, {"start": 221.59, "end": 222.59, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 222.59, "end": 223.59, "text": "And I want pants."}, {"start": 223.59, "end": 224.71, "text": "A lot of people want a lot of things."}, {"start": 224.71, "end": 226.07000000000002, "text": "It won't hurt to hear them out, will it?"}, {"start": 226.07000000000002, "end": 227.67000000000002, "text": "We've got a good hiding spot in the library."}, {"start": 227.67000000000002, "end": 231.73000000000002, "text": "As safe as you are here,"}, {"start": 231.73000000000002, "end": 235.79000000000002, "text": "you'll be safer with us."}, {"start": 235.79000000000002, "end": 237.75000000000003, "text": "Math Club has gotten a lot better since last year."}, {"start": 237.75000000000003, "end": 240.87, "text": "Obviously, they were practicing while the rest of us went on dates."}, {"start": 240.87, "end": 245.19000000000003, "text": "Hold on, I have a plan."}, {"start": 245.19000000000003, "end": 246.19000000000003, "text": "Math Club?"}, {"start": 246.19000000000003, "end": 247.19000000000003, "text": "Yeah?"}, {"start": 247.19000000000003, "end": 248.19000000000003, "text": "I'm Asian."}, {"start": 248.19000000000003, "end": 249.19000000000003, "text": "You guys Asian?"}, {"start": 249.19000000000003, "end": 250.19000000000003, "text": "It's pretty racist, man."}, {"start": 250.19000000000003, "end": 251.19000000000003, "text": "That wasn't a no."}, {"start": 251.19000000000003, "end": 252.19000000000003, "text": "I'm coming over."}, {"start": 252.19000000000003, "end": 253.19000000000003, "text": "Don't shoot me."}, {"start": 253.19000000000003, "end": 254.19000000000003, "text": "Shoot him."}, {"start": 254.19000000000003, "end": 255.19000000000003, "text": "He's wild."}, {"start": 255.19000000000003, "end": 256.19000000000005, "text": "I'm not."}, {"start": 256.19000000000005, "end": 257.19000000000005, "text": "I'm not."}, {"start": 257.19000000000005, "end": 258.19000000000005, "text": "I'm not."}, {"start": 258.19000000000005, "end": 259.19, "text": "I'm not."}, {"start": 259.19, "end": 260.19, "text": "I'm not."}, {"start": 260.19, "end": 261.19, "text": "I'm not."}, {"start": 261.19, "end": 262.19, "text": "I'm not."}, {"start": 262.19, "end": 263.19, "text": "I'm not."}, {"start": 263.19, "end": 264.19, "text": "I'm not."}, {"start": 264.19, "end": 265.19, "text": "I'm not."}, {"start": 265.19, "end": 266.19, "text": "I'm not."}, {"start": 266.19, "end": 267.19, "text": "I'm not."}, {"start": 267.19, "end": 268.19, "text": "I'm not."}, {"start": 268.19, "end": 269.19, "text": "I'm not."}, {"start": 269.19, "end": 270.19, "text": "I'm not."}, {"start": 270.19, "end": 271.19, "text": "I'm not."}, {"start": 271.19, "end": 272.19, "text": "I'm not."}, {"start": 272.19, "end": 273.19, "text": "I'm not."}, {"start": 273.19, "end": 274.19, "text": "I'm not."}, {"start": 274.19, "end": 275.19, "text": "I'm not."}, {"start": 275.19, "end": 276.19, "text": "I'm not."}, {"start": 276.19, "end": 277.19, "text": "I'm not."}, {"start": 277.19, "end": 278.19, "text": "I'm not."}, {"start": 278.19, "end": 279.19, "text": "I'm not."}, {"start": 279.19, "end": 280.19, "text": "I'm not."}, {"start": 280.19, "end": 281.19, "text": "I'm not."}, {"start": 281.19, "end": 282.19, "text": "I'm not."}, {"start": 282.19, "end": 283.19, "text": "I'm not."}, {"start": 283.19, "end": 284.19, "text": "I'm not."}, {"start": 284.19, "end": 285.19, "text": "I'm not."}, {"start": 285.19, "end": 286.19, "text": "He's white and he's out of ammo."}, {"start": 286.19, "end": 287.19, "text": "I'm out of paint."}, {"start": 287.19, "end": 288.19, "text": "Cool."}, {"start": 288.19, "end": 290.19, "text": "Yeah, I'm much safer with you guys."}, {"start": 290.19, "end": 291.19, "text": "M'lady."}, {"start": 291.19, "end": 293.19, "text": "What do you want, Jeff?"}, {"start": 293.19, "end": 294.19, "text": "Yikes."}, {"start": 294.19, "end": 295.19, "text": "Well, what do we all want?"}, {"start": 295.19, "end": 296.19, "text": "Ammo."}, {"start": 296.19, "end": 297.19, "text": "How much you got left?"}, {"start": 297.19, "end": 298.19, "text": "A hundred thousand dollars worth."}, {"start": 298.19, "end": 299.19, "text": "Yeah, we're running low too."}, {"start": 299.19, "end": 300.19, "text": "Shut up, Popit."}, {"start": 300.19, "end": 301.19, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 301.19, "end": 302.19, "text": "What have you heard about Pierce?"}, {"start": 302.19, "end": 303.19, "text": "He's still alive."}, {"start": 303.19, "end": 305.19, "text": "Hold up near the cafeteria."}, {"start": 305.19, "end": 308.19, "text": "Well, I hear he has more paint than a French kindergarten."}, {"start": 308.19, "end": 309.19, "text": "You proposing we join him?"}, {"start": 309.19, "end": 311.19, "text": "I'm proposing his ammo joins us."}, {"start": 311.19, "end": 312.19, "text": "You haven't changed."}, {"start": 312.19, "end": 313.19, "text": "You think Pierce has?"}, {"start": 313.19, "end": 314.19, "text": "Annie, let's not rehash this."}, {"start": 314.19, "end": 316.19, "text": "The guy's been a jerk all year."}, {"start": 316.19, "end": 317.19, "text": "He's a jerk because we exclude him."}, {"start": 317.19, "end": 320.19, "text": "We exclude him because he's a jerk."}, {"start": 320.19, "end": 323.19, "text": "And the last time I checked, you were the last one feeling sorry about it."}, {"start": 336.19, "end": 338.19, "text": "I guess I'm still waiting for you guys to come around."}, {"start": 338.19, "end": 339.19, "text": "Likewise."}, {"start": 343.19, "end": 344.19, "text": "Get me a bitch."}, {"start": 344.19, "end": 345.19, "text": "Get me a bitch."}, {"start": 348.19, "end": 350.19, "text": "Who wears spurs and people?"}, {"start": 365.19, "end": 367.19, "text": "Who the hell are you?"}, {"start": 367.19, "end": 368.19, "text": "The guy's gonna win."}, {"start": 373.19, "end": 374.19, "text": "Come on!"}, {"start": 387.19, "end": 388.19, "text": "Does that guy even go to this school?"}, {"start": 388.19, "end": 389.19, "text": "He's really good looking."}, {"start": 389.19, "end": 391.19, "text": "Like network TV good looking."}, {"start": 391.19, "end": 392.19, "text": "And did you see how big his guns were?"}, {"start": 392.19, "end": 393.19, "text": "Why didn't you just marry him, Opak?"}, {"start": 393.19, "end": 395.19, "text": "I'm just saying, paintball is tough this year."}, {"start": 395.19, "end": 396.19, "text": "I agree."}, {"start": 398.19, "end": 399.19, "text": "Careful, Britta."}, {"start": 399.19, "end": 401.19, "text": "You can't hit all three of us."}, {"start": 401.19, "end": 402.19, "text": "She won't have to."}, {"start": 404.19, "end": 405.19, "text": "I thought you were dead."}, {"start": 405.19, "end": 406.19, "text": "I thought you were dead."}, {"start": 406.19, "end": 407.19, "text": "Dies."}, {"start": 407.19, "end": 408.19, "text": "Oh, right."}, {"start": 408.19, "end": 411.19, "text": "By the power invested in us as deputies, we now pronounce you arrested."}, {"start": 411.19, "end": 412.19, "text": "Deputies?"}, {"start": 412.19, "end": 413.19, "text": "What are you, deputies of the stairwell?"}, {"start": 413.19, "end": 414.19, "text": "Fort Hawthorne."}, {"start": 415.19, "end": 417.19, "text": "There's a bounty on your head, my friend."}, {"start": 417.19, "end": 418.19, "text": "Piers."}, {"start": 419.19, "end": 421.19, "text": "My forehead's not that big, right?"}, {"start": 421.19, "end": 422.19, "text": "It's not small."}, {"start": 423.19, "end": 424.19, "text": "Oh, I'm sorry."}, {"start": 424.19, "end": 425.19, "text": "I'm sorry."}, {"start": 429.43699999999995, "end": 430.43699999999995, "text": "I'm sorry."}, {"start": 431.43699999999995, "end": 432.43699999999995, "text": "I'm sorry."}, {"start": 433.43699999999995, "end": 436.43699999999995, "text": "It's not small."}, {"start": 438.43699999999995, "end": 441.43699999999995, "text": "So you guys just let Piers boss you around in exchange for paint pellets?"}, {"start": 441.43699999999995, "end": 444.43699999999995, "text": "Actually, Jeff, he's been pretty decent in this game so far."}, {"start": 444.43699999999995, "end": 445.953129032258, "text": "He's created a safe zone where people can rest,"}, {"start": 445.953129032258, "end": 447.43699999999995, "text": "eat, and if necessary, pump their breast milk."}, {"start": 447.43699999999995, "end": 449.43699999999995, "text": "Well, that sounds very nice of him."}, {"start": 449.43699999999995, "end": 453.43699999999995, "text": "Feet standing around with empty guns waiting to get picked off by the Black Rider."}, {"start": 453.43699999999995, "end": 456.43699999999995, "text": "Are you talking about the handsome blonde cowboy with the big guns?"}, {"start": 456.43699999999995, "end": 457.43699999999995, "text": "Is that guy a student?"}, {"start": 457.43699999999995, "end": 458.43699999999995, "text": "Who is he?"}, {"start": 458.43699999999995, "end": 459.43699999999995, "text": "We just call him the Black Rider."}, {"start": 459.43699999999995, "end": 461.43699999999995, "text": "Okay, but he's not really writing anything."}, {"start": 461.43699999999995, "end": 463.43699999999995, "text": "Look, I don't name people Annie."}, {"start": 463.43699999999995, "end": 464.43699999999995, "text": "I'm a deputy."}, {"start": 464.43699999999995, "end": 466.43699999999995, "text": "I deputize."}, {"start": 466.43699999999995, "end": 468.43699999999995, "text": "You have to surrender your guns."}, {"start": 469.43699999999995, "end": 470.43699999999995, "text": "And your drugs."}, {"start": 489.43699999999995, "end": 492.43699999999995, "text": "Ah, my study group."}, {"start": 493.43699999999995, "end": 494.43699999999995, "text": "How long has it been?"}, {"start": 494.43699999999995, "end": 495.43699999999995, "text": "Five hours."}, {"start": 495.43699999999995, "end": 496.43699999999995, "text": "Too long."}, {"start": 496.43699999999995, "end": 498.43699999999995, "text": "Welcome to Fort Hawthorne."}, {"start": 498.43699999999995, "end": 500.43699999999995, "text": "How is this even possible?"}, {"start": 500.43699999999995, "end": 502.43699999999995, "text": "It began with a dream, Annie."}, {"start": 502.43699999999995, "end": 505.43699999999995, "text": "A dream and an impulse to hide in the men's room."}, {"start": 505.43699999999995, "end": 508.2205051546391, "text": "I found that people were willing to roll bullets under"}, {"start": 508.2205051546391, "end": 510.43699999999995, "text": "the door just for the right to take a dump."}, {"start": 510.43699999999995, "end": 513.4369999999999, "text": "By the way, for you guys taking your dumps on the house."}, {"start": 513.4369999999999, "end": 517.4369999999999, "text": "Or if you prefer, relax and catch a show."}, {"start": 520.4369999999999, "end": 521.4369999999999, "text": "This is insane."}, {"start": 521.4369999999999, "end": 522.4369999999999, "text": "Don't worry, Jeff."}, {"start": 522.4369999999999, "end": 525.4369999999999, "text": "I've also got someone more your speed."}, {"start": 527.4369999999999, "end": 528.4369999999999, "text": "Because you're gay."}, {"start": 528.4369999999999, "end": 529.4369999999999, "text": "All right, I think I've seen enough."}, {"start": 529.4369999999999, "end": 531.4369999999999, "text": "And I'd like my gun back now."}, {"start": 533.4369999999999, "end": 536.4369999999999, "text": "Only Hawthorne personnel can carry weapons inside, Jeffrey."}, {"start": 536.4369999999999, "end": 539.4369999999999, "text": "All right, you got us here unarmed at your mercy."}, {"start": 539.4369999999999, "end": 540.4369999999999, "text": "What do you want?"}, {"start": 540.4369999999999, "end": 542.4369999999999, "text": "We'll discuss over dinner."}, {"start": 542.4369999999999, "end": 543.4369999999999, "text": "You're famished."}, {"start": 543.4369999999999, "end": 545.4369999999999, "text": "Tonight, we feast."}, {"start": 548.4369999999999, "end": 551.4369999999999, "text": "Uh, the Twinkies are wonderful tonight."}, {"start": 554.4369999999999, "end": 556.4369999999999, "text": "Give us some space, Miguel."}, {"start": 556.4369999999999, "end": 558.652909090909, "text": "What if I told you guys I know where to"}, {"start": 558.652909090909, "end": 561.4369999999999, "text": "find enough ammo to end this cowardly hiding out."}, {"start": 564.241, "end": 566.241, "text": "Split the prize seven ways."}, {"start": 566.241, "end": 569.241, "text": "So send your goons to get it, and they'd never bring it back."}, {"start": 569.241, "end": 570.241, "text": "We trust each other."}, {"start": 570.241, "end": 571.241, "text": "We're a study group."}, {"start": 571.241, "end": 574.241, "text": "That's pretty warm and fuzzy talk coming from you, Pierce."}, {"start": 574.241, "end": 576.241, "text": "You've kind of acted like a villain this year."}, {"start": 576.241, "end": 577.241, "text": "I have."}, {"start": 577.241, "end": 578.241, "text": "You raped a decaying family."}, {"start": 578.241, "end": 582.241, "text": "You guys, Pierce is reaching out."}, {"start": 582.241, "end": 584.2634719101123, "text": "I'm not risking my butt hauling ammo back for"}, {"start": 584.2634719101123, "end": 586.241, "text": "the guy that has Vicky dancing for Twinkies."}, {"start": 586.241, "end": 588.241, "text": "She's a dance major, Jeff."}, {"start": 588.241, "end": 589.241, "text": "She loves Twinkies."}, {"start": 589.241, "end": 596.241, "text": "And if you ever took the time to get to know her, look, uh, summer starts tomorrow."}, {"start": 596.241, "end": 603.241, "text": "For you guys, it means pool parties, dinners, one-night stands."}, {"start": 603.241, "end": 609.241, "text": "For me, it means counting down the days till next fall."}, {"start": 609.241, "end": 613.241, "text": "Before we go, let me do this for you."}, {"start": 613.241, "end": 615.241, "text": "Let me bring us victory."}, {"start": 630.939, "end": 636.199, "text": "♪♪"}, {"start": 636.199, "end": 637.779, "text": "Fine."}, {"start": 637.779, "end": 639.539, "text": "Let's do it."}, {"start": 639.539, "end": 640.699, "text": "To the study group."}, {"start": 640.699, "end": 642.539, "text": "To the study group!"}, {"start": 642.539, "end": 644.539, "text": "♪♪"}, {"start": 644.539, "end": 646.1189999999999, "text": "More juice, Miguel?"}, {"start": 646.1189999999999, "end": 648.419, "text": "♪♪"}, {"start": 648.419, "end": 650.879, "text": "I hope we find this cache of ammunition soon."}, {"start": 650.879, "end": 651.879, "text": "I need to -- Oh."}, {"start": 651.879, "end": 653.679, "text": "Me, too."}, {"start": 653.679, "end": 655.259, "text": "You're talking about peeing, right?"}, {"start": 655.259, "end": 655.5161428571429, "text": "No."}, {"start": 655.5161428571429, "end": 656.459, "text": "Me neither."}, {"start": 656.459, "end": 659.7189999999999, "text": "Look, about Pierce, I feel bad."}, {"start": 659.7189999999999, "end": 661.299, "text": "I shouldn't put so much effort into it."}, {"start": 661.299, "end": 662.759, "text": "It's okay."}, {"start": 662.759, "end": 665.5989999999999, "text": "I just think the study group is my family, you know?"}, {"start": 665.5989999999999, "end": 667.0989999999999, "text": "And if we start picking and choosing --"}, {"start": 667.0989999999999, "end": 668.299, "text": "Where do we stop?"}, {"start": 668.299, "end": 669.899, "text": "I get it."}, {"start": 669.899, "end": 671.399, "text": "You're a good kid."}, {"start": 671.399, "end": 674.9789999999999, "text": "And I want to do my part to help you stay that way."}, {"start": 678.0249999999999, "end": 679.5249999999999, "text": "Benjamin Chang,"}, {"start": 679.5249999999999, "end": 682.1649999999998, "text": "for your betrayal of the cheerleader's alliance,"}, {"start": 682.1649999999998, "end": 684.6249999999999, "text": "I sentence you to pretend he's deaf."}, {"start": 684.6249999999999, "end": 687.0249999999999, "text": "Guys, you don't have to do this."}, {"start": 687.0249999999999, "end": 688.6249999999999, "text": "I betrayed the math club for you."}, {"start": 688.6249999999999, "end": 689.6249999999999, "text": "Ready?"}, {"start": 689.6249999999999, "end": 690.496219512195, "text": "Heather, I'm sorry."}, {"start": 690.496219512195, "end": 691.5049999999999, "text": "Don't turn your phone."}, {"start": 691.5049999999999, "end": 693.7049999999999, "text": "Aim fire."}, {"start": 693.7049999999999, "end": 695.1049999999999, "text": "[Gunshots]"}, {"start": 697.4449999999999, "end": 698.6449999999999, "text": "Holy crap."}, {"start": 698.6449999999999, "end": 699.8449999999999, "text": "Not cool, bitch."}, {"start": 699.8449999999999, "end": 702.0849999999999, "text": "Yeah, so you told me at last year's tryouts."}, {"start": 702.0849999999999, "end": 703.7449999999999, "text": "[Grunts]"}, {"start": 703.7449999999999, "end": 704.8849999999999, "text": "Leave the guns."}, {"start": 704.8849999999999, "end": 707.0849999999999, "text": "Whatever."}, {"start": 707.0849999999999, "end": 708.425, "text": "Who's there?"}, {"start": 708.425, "end": 709.675, "text": "Can I join you?"}, {"start": 709.675, "end": 709.925, "text": "No."}, {"start": 709.925, "end": 710.7249999999999, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 710.7249999999999, "end": 713.665, "text": "[Knocking]"}, {"start": 713.665, "end": 714.3149999999999, "text": "General, I'm out."}, {"start": 714.3149999999999, "end": 714.9649999999999, "text": "Give me your gun."}, {"start": 714.9649999999999, "end": 716.6249999999999, "text": "All right, be careful."}, {"start": 716.6249999999999, "end": 718.3649999999999, "text": "Cheerleaders rule!"}, {"start": 718.3649999999999, "end": 722.0649999999999, "text": "[Grunts]"}, {"start": 722.0649999999999, "end": 726.9649999999999, "text": "♪♪"}, {"start": 729.576, "end": 732.216, "text": "I'll take that."}, {"start": 732.216, "end": 734.4159999999999, "text": "Who are you?"}, {"start": 734.4159999999999, "end": 737.496, "text": "I'm the bad guy."}, {"start": 737.496, "end": 740.196, "text": "Stop trying to fluster me with your handsomeness."}, {"start": 740.196, "end": 741.796, "text": "You're creepy."}, {"start": 741.796, "end": 744.656, "text": "Why is your chest getting all flushed?"}, {"start": 744.656, "end": 746.5360000000001, "text": "It's a rash."}, {"start": 746.5360000000001, "end": 748.496, "text": "I'm allergic to beans."}, {"start": 748.496, "end": 750.136, "text": "Look, do you think I'll go to school here?"}, {"start": 750.136, "end": 752.296, "text": "Sorry, I get paid to shoot paintballs, honey."}, {"start": 752.296, "end": 754.0360000000001, "text": "Not the breeze."}, {"start": 754.0360000000001, "end": 755.676, "text": "We haven't."}, {"start": 755.676, "end": 757.236, "text": "I'll hit you in the foot."}, {"start": 757.236, "end": 758.836, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 758.836, "end": 761.376, "text": "♪♪"}, {"start": 761.376, "end": 764.876, "text": "[Gunshots]"}, {"start": 764.876, "end": 766.7760000000001, "text": "Let's try and shoot him."}, {"start": 766.7760000000001, "end": 770.016, "text": "♪♪"}, {"start": 770.016, "end": 771.656, "text": "Hey."}, {"start": 771.656, "end": 773.456, "text": "Hey."}, {"start": 773.456, "end": 778.5360000000001, "text": "♪♪"}, {"start": 778.5360000000001, "end": 780.336, "text": "I'll save you for last."}, {"start": 780.336, "end": 781.596, "text": "You won't get the chance."}, {"start": 781.596, "end": 782.596, "text": "[Grunts]"}, {"start": 782.596, "end": 789.576, "text": "♪♪"}, {"start": 789.576, "end": 798.7760000000001, "text": "♪♪"}, {"start": 798.7760000000001, "end": 800.456, "text": "You okay?"}, {"start": 800.456, "end": 801.756, "text": "I got to better look at him."}, {"start": 801.756, "end": 802.856, "text": "He's not that good-looking."}, {"start": 802.856, "end": 804.016, "text": "Didn't he shoot you?"}, {"start": 804.016, "end": 805.016, "text": "He tried."}, {"start": 805.016, "end": 806.356, "text": "He's a bad shot, too?"}, {"start": 806.356, "end": 808.056, "text": "Man, what does his dad going for him?"}, {"start": 808.056, "end": 810.656, "text": "[Gunshots]"}, {"start": 810.656, "end": 812.556, "text": "Pierce loaded your gun with blanks."}, {"start": 812.556, "end": 817.5360000000001, "text": "♪♪"}, {"start": 817.5360000000001, "end": 820.076, "text": "[Grunts]"}, {"start": 820.076, "end": 822.836, "text": "♪♪"}, {"start": 822.836, "end": 824.0360000000001, "text": "No, don't shoot!"}, {"start": 824.0360000000001, "end": 825.316, "text": "Look!"}, {"start": 825.316, "end": 829.376, "text": "Why does this keep happening?"}, {"start": 829.376, "end": 832.376, "text": "And what kind of ice cream company does this?"}, {"start": 832.376, "end": 833.816, "text": "Where's the paintball stuff from last year?"}, {"start": 833.816, "end": 836.9159999999999, "text": "I hid it, so the school doesn't get destroyed again."}, {"start": 836.9159999999999, "end": 838.9159999999999, "text": "Too late."}, {"start": 838.9159999999999, "end": 840.056, "text": "Oh, hi, Jeff."}, {"start": 840.056, "end": 842.196, "text": "We just ran into the Black Rider."}, {"start": 842.196, "end": 844.256, "text": "Dean, if you want this game to end,"}, {"start": 844.256, "end": 845.636, "text": "we need firepower."}, {"start": 845.636, "end": 848.936, "text": "And there..."}, {"start": 851.4720000000001, "end": 854.0120000000001, "text": "the key's in my shorts."}, {"start": 856.83, "end": 859.2900000000001, "text": "I can get it out, I guess."}, {"start": 862.2620000000001, "end": 866.942, "text": "♪♪"}, {"start": 866.942, "end": 869.5020000000001, "text": "Now, this is more like it."}, {"start": 869.5020000000001, "end": 871.6020000000001, "text": "Okay, Black Rider."}, {"start": 871.6020000000001, "end": 874.482, "text": "Now, let's see who's attractive."}, {"start": 874.482, "end": 877.842, "text": "Dude, you have a problem."}, {"start": 877.842, "end": 882.8820000000001, "text": "Oh, nice."}, {"start": 882.8820000000001, "end": 883.25, "text": "Whoa!"}, {"start": 883.25, "end": 884.722, "text": "Where are you going?"}, {"start": 884.722, "end": 887.662, "text": "To have a conversation with Pierce."}, {"start": 887.662, "end": 888.922, "text": "He's pretty awesome today."}, {"start": 888.922, "end": 892.6220000000001, "text": "♪♪"}, {"start": 892.6220000000001, "end": 900.7620000000001, "text": "♪♪"}, {"start": 900.7620000000001, "end": 901.762, "text": "What happened?"}, {"start": 901.762, "end": 903.442, "text": "Black Rider."}, {"start": 903.442, "end": 904.902, "text": "He wiped out the whole fort."}, {"start": 904.902, "end": 906.742, "text": "Then why are you still here?"}, {"start": 906.742, "end": 908.5820000000001, "text": "I can't go back out there."}, {"start": 908.5820000000001, "end": 910.0820000000001, "text": "This is the only life I know."}, {"start": 910.0820000000001, "end": 913.282, "text": "Annie?"}, {"start": 913.282, "end": 917.3820000000001, "text": "Is that you?"}, {"start": 917.3820000000001, "end": 918.3820000000001, "text": "Did you get the ammo?"}, {"start": 918.3820000000001, "end": 919.3820000000001, "text": "Yep."}, {"start": 919.3820000000001, "end": 921.8820000000001, "text": "[Gunshots]"}, {"start": 921.8820000000001, "end": 922.8820000000001, "text": "What are you doing?"}, {"start": 922.8820000000001, "end": 924.722, "text": "Why was Jeff's gun loaded with blanks?"}, {"start": 924.722, "end": 925.722, "text": "What, sir?"}, {"start": 925.722, "end": 932.802, "text": "[Gunshots]"}, {"start": 932.802, "end": 933.902, "text": "Oh, come on now."}, {"start": 933.902, "end": 935.6020000000001, "text": "Hey, hey."}, {"start": 935.6020000000001, "end": 938.002, "text": "Oh, okay."}, {"start": 940.9219999999998, "end": 942.262, "text": "I get it."}, {"start": 942.262, "end": 943.5619999999999, "text": "So once again, I'm the bad guy."}, {"start": 943.5619999999999, "end": 944.6019999999999, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 944.6019999999999, "end": 947.5619999999999, "text": "Well, he got the win last year."}, {"start": 947.5619999999999, "end": 949.3619999999999, "text": "It's a game, Annie's."}, {"start": 949.3619999999999, "end": 950.9619999999999, "text": "Fine."}, {"start": 950.9619999999999, "end": 953.9419999999999, "text": "It's a game."}, {"start": 953.9419999999999, "end": 958.7419999999998, "text": "Let's play."}, {"start": 958.7419999999998, "end": 959.7419999999998, "text": "Put in your holster."}, {"start": 959.7419999999998, "end": 960.7419999999998, "text": "Come on, Annie."}, {"start": 960.7419999999998, "end": 961.7419999999998, "text": "You're my favorite."}, {"start": 961.7419999999998, "end": 962.7419999999998, "text": "I don't want to beat you."}, {"start": 962.7419999999998, "end": 963.9819999999999, "text": "It's just -- I don't want Jeff to be the --"}, {"start": 963.9819999999999, "end": 968.2219999999999, "text": "Put the gun in your holster and let's play the game."}, {"start": 968.2219999999999, "end": 969.7219999999999, "text": "Right."}, {"start": 969.7219999999999, "end": 974.2819999999999, "text": "So you can shoot me and play without me."}, {"start": 974.2819999999999, "end": 976.002, "text": "That's this group's favorite thing."}, {"start": 976.002, "end": 978.6019999999999, "text": "We're always nice to you, Pierce."}, {"start": 978.6019999999999, "end": 979.6019999999999, "text": "Wrong."}, {"start": 979.6019999999999, "end": 980.6019999999999, "text": "Wrong."}, {"start": 980.6019999999999, "end": 984.9619999999999, "text": "Three days ago, I walked in on you guys playing cards without me."}, {"start": 984.9619999999999, "end": 986.4019999999998, "text": "Three days ago."}, {"start": 986.4019999999998, "end": 988.1219999999998, "text": "We weren't playing cards."}, {"start": 988.1219999999998, "end": 989.1219999999998, "text": "We were voting."}, {"start": 989.1219999999998, "end": 991.002, "text": "And you weren't invited because we were voting about you."}, {"start": 991.002, "end": 992.002, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 992.002, "end": 998.002, "text": "We were taking a vote on whether we'd invite you back to the group next year."}, {"start": 998.002, "end": 1000.8419999999999, "text": "Lucky for you, it had to be unanimous."}, {"start": 1005.1780000000001, "end": 1008.1780000000001, "text": "There was one holdout."}, {"start": 1008.1780000000001, "end": 1009.2180000000001, "text": "One red card."}, {"start": 1009.2180000000001, "end": 1010.2180000000001, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1010.2180000000001, "end": 1011.2180000000001, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1011.2180000000001, "end": 1012.2180000000001, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1012.2180000000001, "end": 1013.2180000000001, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1013.2180000000001, "end": 1014.2180000000001, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1014.2180000000001, "end": 1015.2180000000001, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1015.2180000000001, "end": 1016.2180000000001, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1016.2180000000001, "end": 1017.2180000000001, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1017.2180000000001, "end": 1018.2180000000001, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1018.2180000000001, "end": 1019.2180000000001, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1019.2180000000001, "end": 1020.2180000000001, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1020.2180000000001, "end": 1021.2180000000001, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1021.2180000000001, "end": 1022.2180000000001, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1022.2180000000001, "end": 1023.2180000000001, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1023.2180000000001, "end": 1024.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1024.218, "end": 1025.218, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1025.218, "end": 1026.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1026.218, "end": 1027.218, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1027.218, "end": 1028.218, "text": "Pick it up."}, {"start": 1028.218, "end": 1029.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1029.218, "end": 1030.218, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1030.218, "end": 1031.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1031.218, "end": 1032.218, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1032.218, "end": 1033.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1033.218, "end": 1034.218, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1034.218, "end": 1035.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1035.218, "end": 1036.218, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1036.218, "end": 1037.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1037.218, "end": 1038.218, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1038.218, "end": 1039.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1039.218, "end": 1040.218, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1040.218, "end": 1041.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1041.218, "end": 1042.218, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1042.218, "end": 1043.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1043.218, "end": 1044.218, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1044.218, "end": 1045.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1045.218, "end": 1046.218, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1046.218, "end": 1047.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1047.218, "end": 1048.218, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1048.218, "end": 1049.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1049.218, "end": 1050.218, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1050.218, "end": 1051.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1051.218, "end": 1052.218, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1052.218, "end": 1053.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1053.218, "end": 1055.218, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1055.218, "end": 1056.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1056.218, "end": 1057.218, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1057.218, "end": 1058.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1058.218, "end": 1059.218, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1059.218, "end": 1060.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1060.218, "end": 1061.218, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1061.218, "end": 1062.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1062.218, "end": 1063.218, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1063.218, "end": 1064.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1064.218, "end": 1065.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1065.218, "end": 1066.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1066.218, "end": 1067.218, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1067.218, "end": 1071.218, "text": ">> Black Rider, it's Jeff Winger."}, {"start": 1071.218, "end": 1075.218, "text": "I know you've heard of me by now."}, {"start": 1075.218, "end": 1078.218, "text": "No, he's lying."}, {"start": 1078.218, "end": 1082.218, "text": "Look, if you're half a cool cowboy, you pretend to be,"}, {"start": 1082.218, "end": 1085.218, "text": "the fact that we've got a situation playing out here,"}, {"start": 1085.218, "end": 1088.218, "text": "and let us be until it's settled."}, {"start": 1088.218, "end": 1091.218, "text": ">> Sure thing."}, {"start": 1091.218, "end": 1092.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1092.218, "end": 1093.218, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1093.218, "end": 1094.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1094.218, "end": 1095.218, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1095.218, "end": 1096.218, "text": ">> And once it's settled,"}, {"start": 1096.218, "end": 1098.218, "text": "we're taking out everybody in this room."}, {"start": 1098.218, "end": 1099.218, "text": ">> Hope."}, {"start": 1099.218, "end": 1101.4238823529413, "text": ">> Starting with you, Mr."}, {"start": 1101.4238823529413, "end": 1102.218, "text": "Insecure."}, {"start": 1102.218, "end": 1105.218, "text": "You think you're good looking, but you're not."}, {"start": 1105.218, "end": 1107.218, "text": "You're average."}, {"start": 1107.218, "end": 1110.218, "text": "You're just an average looking guy with a big chin."}, {"start": 1110.218, "end": 1112.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1112.218, "end": 1113.218, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1113.218, "end": 1114.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1114.218, "end": 1115.218, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1115.218, "end": 1116.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1116.218, "end": 1117.218, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1117.218, "end": 1118.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1118.218, "end": 1119.218, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1119.218, "end": 1120.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1120.218, "end": 1121.218, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1121.218, "end": 1122.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1122.218, "end": 1123.218, "text": "♪ ♪"}, {"start": 1123.218, "end": 1124.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1124.218, "end": 1125.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1125.218, "end": 1126.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1126.218, "end": 1127.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1127.218, "end": 1128.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1128.218, "end": 1129.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1129.218, "end": 1130.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1130.218, "end": 1131.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1131.218, "end": 1132.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1132.218, "end": 1133.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1133.218, "end": 1134.218, "text": ">> What's going on?"}, {"start": 1134.218, "end": 1135.218, "text": ">> He's faking it."}, {"start": 1135.218, "end": 1136.218, "text": ">> No, something's wrong with him."}, {"start": 1136.218, "end": 1137.218, "text": ">> No, no, no, it's fake."}, {"start": 1137.218, "end": 1140.218, "text": ">> I wanted to get out of letting me have a stick of gum."}, {"start": 1140.218, "end": 1141.218, "text": ">> He's old, though."}, {"start": 1141.218, "end": 1142.218, "text": ">> It could be real."}, {"start": 1142.218, "end": 1143.218, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 1143.218, "end": 1145.218, "text": ">> The gurgling's a nice touch."}, {"start": 1145.218, "end": 1146.218, "text": "You guys are terrible people."}, {"start": 1146.218, "end": 1147.218, "text": ">> Eh, we warned you."}, {"start": 1147.218, "end": 1148.218, "text": ">> Buddy, are you all right?"}, {"start": 1148.218, "end": 1149.218, "text": "You want me to call 911?"}, {"start": 1149.218, "end": 1150.218, "text": "[gunshot]"}, {"start": 1150.218, "end": 1151.218, "text": ">> Sucker!"}, {"start": 1151.218, "end": 1152.218, "text": ">> Son of a bitch!"}, {"start": 1152.218, "end": 1153.218, "text": ">> Seriously?"}, {"start": 1153.218, "end": 1154.218, "text": ">> Told you, dude."}, {"start": 1154.218, "end": 1155.218, "text": ">> I'm the best!"}, {"start": 1155.218, "end": 1156.218, "text": ">> You're the worst!"}, {"start": 1156.218, "end": 1157.218, "text": ">> I'm out of the group!"}, {"start": 1157.218, "end": 1159.218, "text": "You're out of mine!"}, {"start": 1159.218, "end": 1161.218, "text": "And I'm winning!"}, {"start": 1161.218, "end": 1162.218, "text": ">> I created a monster."}, {"start": 1162.218, "end": 1164.218, "text": ">> Let's not give ourselves too much credit."}, {"start": 1164.218, "end": 1165.218, "text": ">> I'm out."}, {"start": 1165.218, "end": 1168.218, "text": "Some old guy pretended to have a heart attack"}, {"start": 1168.218, "end": 1169.218, "text": "and shot me in the gut."}, {"start": 1169.218, "end": 1170.218, "text": ">> I don't care."}, {"start": 1170.218, "end": 1172.218, "text": "That's your problem."}, {"start": 1172.218, "end": 1173.218, "text": ">> The school sucks."}, {"start": 1173.218, "end": 1175.218, "text": ">> Well, then why do you go here?"}, {"start": 1175.218, "end": 1178.218, "text": ">> I wouldn't go to this toilet with my big sister's toe."}, {"start": 1178.218, "end": 1180.218, "text": "I'd take a class online."}, {"start": 1180.218, "end": 1181.218, "text": "I was paid to be here and win the game"}, {"start": 1181.218, "end": 1184.218, "text": "so my boss could keep his prize money."}, {"start": 1184.218, "end": 1186.218, "text": ">> You work for the ice cream company?"}, {"start": 1186.218, "end": 1187.218, "text": ">> Sweetie, this thing is so much bigger"}, {"start": 1187.218, "end": 1190.218, "text": "than you can even imagine."}, {"start": 1190.218, "end": 1191.218, "text": "I'm out of here."}, {"start": 1191.218, "end": 1194.218, "text": "I got Coldplay tickets."}, {"start": 1194.218, "end": 1195.218, "text": ">> Coldplay?"}, {"start": 1195.218, "end": 1197.218, "text": ">> Too late, bean allergy."}, {"start": 1197.218, "end": 1199.218, "text": "You blow it."}, {"start": 1199.218, "end": 1201.218, "text": ">> Hello?"}, {"start": 1201.218, "end": 1204.218, "text": "Anybody?"}, {"start": 1204.218, "end": 1207.218, "text": "Does anyone have an alliance I can join?"}, {"start": 1207.218, "end": 1210.218, "text": "I'm really loyal."}, {"start": 1210.218, "end": 1218.218, "text": "[screaming]"}, {"start": 1218.218, "end": 1221.218, "text": "Am I out?"}, {"start": 1221.218, "end": 1231.218, "text": "[inaudible]"}, {"start": 1231.218, "end": 1233.218, "text": ">> On your knees."}, {"start": 1233.218, "end": 1237.218, "text": "No Greendale student can be allowed to win this game."}, {"start": 1237.218, "end": 1243.218, "text": "Initiate plan B, operation total invasion."}, {"start": 1243.218, "end": 1247.218, "text": ">> Greendale students, I understand you've unified"}, {"start": 1250.0859999999998, "end": 1253.0859999999998, "text": "and intend to draw this game out."}, {"start": 1253.0859999999998, "end": 1257.0859999999998, "text": ">> Well, if it's a war you want, it's a war you shall lose."}, {"start": 1257.0859999999998, "end": 1263.0859999999998, "text": "Resistance is as pointless as your degree."}, {"start": 1263.0859999999998, "end": 1265.0859999999998, "text": ">> Are we the little rascals?"}, {"start": 1265.0859999999998, "end": 1266.0859999999998, "text": ">> I was."}, {"start": 1266.0859999999998, "end": 1267.0859999999998, "text": ">> On your knees."}, {"start": 1267.0859999999998, "end": 1268.0859999999998, "text": "Stop shooting me."}, {"start": 1268.0859999999998, "end": 1270.0859999999998, "text": ">> We're going to lose this war and this school."}, {"start": 1270.0859999999998, "end": 1271.0859999999998, "text": ">> Looks like this is it."}, {"start": 1271.0859999999998, "end": 1272.0859999999998, "text": ">> We're dying out here."}, {"start": 1272.0859999999998, "end": 1273.0859999999998, "text": ">> I was dreaming about it this way."}, {"start": 1273.0859999999998, "end": 1274.0859999999998, "text": ">> Once I'm gone, I'm gone,"}, {"start": 1274.0859999999998, "end": 1275.0859999999998, "text": "and I guess I'll see you right now."}, {"start": 1275.0859999999998, "end": 1277.0859999999998, "text": ">> That's just the tip of the iceberg."}, {"start": 1283.0859999999998, "end": 1283.58, "text": "[BLANK_AUDIO]"}]}